      ],
      "extract": "One can define a connection on a right $T_{\\theta }^{d}$-module $E$ as a set of ${\\mathbb C}$-linear operators $\\nabla _{1},...,\\nabla _{d}$ obeying Leibniz rule: $$\\nabla _{\\alpha }(ea)=\\nabla _{\\alpha }e\\cdot a+e\\cdot \\delta _{\\alpha }a\\label{con}$$ where $e\\in E,a\\in T_{\\theta }^{d}$ and the derivatives $\\delta _{\\alpha }a$ are specified by the formula $\\delta _{\\alpha }U_{\\overrightarrow{n}}=2\\pi",
